    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KUU is an atmospheric moonbase management game, where you play as a silent caretaker trapped in the fading light of a broken moonhouse. To survive for 30 nights you must balance your scarce resources. Grow meager rations in the weak earthlight. Navigate the emotional sanity of a fragile sisterhood. Decode ancient documents in search of secrets. Your only choices will be impossible ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/ebaa18db4eeed8343dc24023aed839ad.poster.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/ebaa18db4eeed8343dc24023aed839ad.webm?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/ebaa18db4eeed8343dc24023aed839ad.mp4?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/280d91ded16e6abc5fc22c27d63d772b.webp?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=40 /></span>After a mysterious blast from a long-abandoned Earth disables the moonhouse, the difficult decisions begin. You have precious little time and must choose what tasks are vital. Do you puzzle the solar panels together for maximum yield, download more documents in your search for clues, or use the comm desk to decipher some remote hope of rescue? It\u2019s a fragile ecosystem, and time is not on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/0ebdb24c6049a2a1b7ac25039551a48a.poster.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/0ebdb24c6049a2a1b7ac25039551a48a.webm?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/0ebdb24c6049a2a1b7ac25039551a48a.mp4?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/5b448fd8bab0c10d9deda1fa2d4e4916.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=76 /></span>As tensions rise and food runs low, the fragile sisterhood of the moonhouse will be held together or pulled apart by the stories you uncover. Kuu has been mute since her arrival in the sealed ecosystem. You can answer your sisters only by nodding yes or no. Some will starve, and some will snap. It will be your fault.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/b78a95a26f3ee41348d1894ac3a61d25.poster.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/b78a95a26f3ee41348d1894ac3a61d25.webm?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/b78a95a26f3ee41348d1894ac3a61d25.mp4?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/4a9fd27bb5323fb2b3a74c50df571130.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=76 /></span>Harvest just enough to keep hunger at bay, or risk planting seed for hope of a better yield tomorrow. Turning on the solar panels will help you collect a bit more energy, but they block the precious light your plants need to survive. Give it your best try, before you have to return to hibernation in your sleeper cell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/cfe1fa1d49e331384411796e805a9d03.poster.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/cfe1fa1d49e331384411796e805a9d03.webm?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/cfe1fa1d49e331384411796e805a9d03.mp4?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/92053ea1df452468983c41c1c42c9414.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a demanding day, your sleeper cell is the only place that feels safe. Here, in the stillness, you pore through the sacred monograph, an ancient study by a disgraced pseudo-archaeologist, for the secret to your sisterhood\u2019s final chance at survival. Can you use what you learn, before running out of time?\u00a0In the isolated emotional ecosystem of KUU, every impossible choice you make will long echo in the dark.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KUU is an atmospheric moonbase management game, where you play as a silent caretaker trapped in the fading light of a broken moonhouse. To survive for 30 nights you must balance your scarce resources. Grow meager rations in the weak earthlight. Navigate the emotional sanity of a fragile sisterhood. Decode ancient documents in search of secrets. Your only choices will be impossible ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/ebaa18db4eeed8343dc24023aed839ad.poster.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/ebaa18db4eeed8343dc24023aed839ad.webm?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/ebaa18db4eeed8343dc24023aed839ad.mp4?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/280d91ded16e6abc5fc22c27d63d772b.webp?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=40 /></span>After a mysterious blast from a long-abandoned Earth disables the moonhouse, the difficult decisions begin. You have precious little time and must choose what tasks are vital. Do you puzzle the solar panels together for maximum yield, download more documents in your search for clues, or use the comm desk to decipher some remote hope of rescue? It\u2019s a fragile ecosystem, and time is not on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/0ebdb24c6049a2a1b7ac25039551a48a.poster.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/0ebdb24c6049a2a1b7ac25039551a48a.webm?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/0ebdb24c6049a2a1b7ac25039551a48a.mp4?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/5b448fd8bab0c10d9deda1fa2d4e4916.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=76 /></span>As tensions rise and food runs low, the fragile sisterhood of the moonhouse will be held together or pulled apart by the stories you uncover. Kuu has been mute since her arrival in the sealed ecosystem. You can answer your sisters only by nodding yes or no. Some will starve, and some will snap. It will be your fault.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/b78a95a26f3ee41348d1894ac3a61d25.poster.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/b78a95a26f3ee41348d1894ac3a61d25.webm?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/b78a95a26f3ee41348d1894ac3a61d25.mp4?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/4a9fd27bb5323fb2b3a74c50df571130.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=76 /></span>Harvest just enough to keep hunger at bay, or risk planting seed for hope of a better yield tomorrow. Turning on the solar panels will help you collect a bit more energy, but they block the precious light your plants need to survive. Give it your best try, before you have to return to hibernation in your sleeper cell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/cfe1fa1d49e331384411796e805a9d03.poster.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/cfe1fa1d49e331384411796e805a9d03.webm?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/cfe1fa1d49e331384411796e805a9d03.mp4?t=1752178116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442050/extras/92053ea1df452468983c41c1c42c9414.avif?t=1752178116\" width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a demanding day, your sleeper cell is the only place that feels safe. Here, in the stillness, you pore through the sacred monograph, an ancient study by a disgraced pseudo-archaeologist, for the secret to your sisterhood\u2019s final chance at survival. Can you use what you learn, before running out of time?\u00a0In the isolated emotional ecosystem of KUU, every impossible choice you make will long echo in the dark.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Trapped in the fading light of a broken moonhouse, you have 30 nights to balance scarce resources. Grow meager rations in the weak earthlight. Navigate the emotional sanity of a fragile sisterhood. Decode ancient documents in search of secrets. Your only choices will be impossible ones.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cIf you dream of playing a game set inside a diagram of a spacebase from an Usborne Cutaway book published in the 1990s, Kuu is probably for you. If you dream of being very sad on the Moon, tending sickly plants for 30 days by Earthlight, then Kuu is also, probably, for you. If you enjoyed Citizen Sleeper but wish it was as depressing as, say, Anoxia Station, Kuu is also also, probably, for you.\u201d<br>ROCK, PAPER, SHOTGUN first look (news) by Edwin Evans-Thirlwell<br>",
